content.text:
The spec lists four v2 bearer-protected routes. The only one whose response carries a `manifest_id` is `GET /v2/imagery/manifest`, and it returned HTTP 200 with the elevated token.

```json
{
  "manifest_id": "man-7c2e-2201"
}
```
